# 本仓库按原始字节保存所有文件，不做换行符归一化：
# RTL/软件源码、bitstream、XSA 与各报告都是实测产物的直接拷贝，
# 任何 CRLF→LF 转换都会改变文件哈希，破坏"产物与报告可对照"的可追溯性。

# Git LFS：超过 GitHub 100 MB 单文件限制的模型权重资产
board/deployment/QWEN25/WEIGHTS.BIN filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
board/deployment/QWEN25/EMBED.BIN   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
board/deployment/QWEN25/LMW.BIN     filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# 二进制
*.bit      binary
*.xsa      binary
*.dcp      binary
*.bin      binary
*.BIN      binary
*.exe      binary
*.dll      binary
*.a        binary
*.elf      binary
*.ELF      binary
*.mp4      binary
*.zip      binary
*.rar      binary
*.rpt      binary
*.log      binary
*.textproto binary
